  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sudan Ecumenical Forum</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Sudan Ecumenical Forum (SEF) launched a 3-year strategic plan in 2009; CAFOD contributed &#xa3;10,000 for the first year (SUD242). In January 2010 a revised &#x201c;Action Plan&#x201d; was agreed providing a longer-term framework for ecumenical engagement in Sudan. Under the Action Plan, SEF will 1) support Church leadership to become a more credible and effective voice to promote reconciliation and government accountability; 2) promote genuine South-South dialogue; 3) encourage greater focus on the Three &#x2018;Transitional&#x2019; Areas; 4) support the Church to contribute to post-referendum planning; and 5) engage in international advocacy to support the implementation of the Comprehensive Peace Agreement (CPA) and the post-referendum era.</narrative>
  </description>
